          "type": "look",
          "content": "$144 = 12^2$."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "$24x = 2 \\times 12x \\times 1$."
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "strategy",
          "content": "الحدّ الأوسط سالب: مربع فرق."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$E = (12x)^2 - 2 \\times 12x \\times 1 + 1^2 = (12x - 1)^2$.",
        "incorrect": "جذر $144x^2$ هو $12x$ لا نصف 144."
      }
    },
    {
